    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Most teenagers dislike reading newspapers. After all, most newspapers are not directly "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "targeted",
            "ref": "v-target"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " towards teens. Young people don’t understand the “hard” language that can be found in them. They can’t focus for long enough to read through a full-page article. They also believe that nothing in these papers is interesting."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Newspapers might not be the most suitable reading materials for teenagers. However, as a teenager, I believe we can still benefit from reading them. And some newspapers have been trying to change to attract younger readers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In some newspapers I have been reading recently, there are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "summaries",
            "ref": "v-summary"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of news that people should know about. I think they are very useful. It is good for teenagers to stay "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "informed",
            "ref": "v-informed"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about the latest developments around the world. Many newspaper articles are too long for us. These summaries can let us know about the key points of the most important news. They may also attract us to try to read the whole news story."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many of us think newspapers are all about business and politics. That’s not always right. Many newspapers are not as boring as you might think. Once you go beyond those first couple of pages, you are likely to find articles about basketball, dance, painting, and even pop stars. Many newspapers are just like the magazines that we enjoy reading. Some also usually have a section with comics and games, like crosswords. As you “"
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "roam",
            "ref": "v-roam"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " around” in a newspaper, you are likely to see articles that are related to your hobbies."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "Many newspapers are for teens, too."
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " You just need to be willing to settle down and then "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "flip",
            "ref": "v-flip"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a few pages."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
